cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "reteval: reproducible evaluation of ranked retrieval runs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Serikbekov
    given-names: Nurzhan
    affiliation: Astana IT University
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nurzhvn52/reteval"
abstract: >-
  Command-line tool and Python library that evaluates ranked retrieval runs in
  TREC format, aggregates repeated runs of a system over random seeds and
  compares systems with a baseline using a paired randomization test and
  bootstrap confidence intervals.
keywords:
  - information retrieval
  - evaluation
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - reproducibility
  - significance testing
